    {
      "edition": "Bash 5.3, systemd 262.2 current manuals, and Linux man-pages 6.19 references checked 2026-11-20",
      "items": [
        "Bash 5.3 (released 2025) added current-shell command substitution forms `${ command; }` and `${| command; }`, GLOBSORT, compgen -V, read -E, source -p, bash_source_fullpath, BASH_MONOSECONDS, and BASH_TRAPSIG; these are Bash-specific and may be absent on older distro shells. systemd 262.2 (latest stable tag checked 2026-11-20) adds RestartRandomizedDelaySec= for jittering automatic restarts and includes newer service directives; inspect systemd --version and local manuals before use. Linux man-pages 6.19 is the latest project release listed at the snapshot date. Distribution packaging and default firewall/resolver/log paths vary."
      ],
